00:11:21.989 --> 00:11:25.379
and we steamrolled on
in and we genocide them.

00:11:25.379 --> 00:11:27.269
I mean, hell, we owe 'em somethin'.

00:11:27.269 --> 00:11:28.102
- There ya go.

00:11:28.102 --> 00:11:31.029
(bottles clinking)

00:11:31.029 --> 00:11:31.862
- I gotta tell you, man,

00:11:31.862 --> 00:11:34.037
that's not bad for a non-alcoholic beer.

00:11:34.037 --> 00:11:35.104
- Not bad at all.

00:11:35.104 --> 00:11:38.509
All right, I gotta go
home, take care of my kids.

00:11:38.509 --> 00:11:40.064
- How many of 'em you got now?

00:11:40.064 --> 00:11:41.857
- Just adopted the 11th.

00:11:41.857 --> 00:11:43.139
Can't help myself.

00:11:43.139 --> 00:11:44.700
- Man, that's always what happens when

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.631
you volunteer for the
earthquake relief in Haiti.

00:11:47.631 --> 00:11:48.819
- Yep yep yep.

00:11:48.819 --> 00:11:49.711
- What ya gon' do?

00:11:49.711 --> 00:11:50.860
- Whatcha gon' do?

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:53.477
You know, my wife makes
two thirds of what I make.

00:11:53.477 --> 00:11:55.714
- What? Y'all got the same job, man.

00:11:55.714 --> 00:11:57.724
That's just patently unfair.

00:11:57.724 --> 00:11:59.719
- That's right, we're both librarians.

00:11:59.719 --> 00:12:00.954
(Keegan belching)

00:12:00.954 --> 00:12:01.787
You all right?

00:12:01.787 --> 00:12:02.788
- I'm okay.

00:12:02.788 --> 00:12:06.705
(funky percussive theme music)

